e fighting back  it's a strange film with an even  stranger premise  no  I don't know Bird Box was released on  Netflix in 2018 and it seemed to share a  lot of DNA with the Shyamalan film Bird  Box follows Sandra Bullock and her  children as they seek a safe haven from  an apocalyptic condition that has swept  the entire Globe something is causing  people to take their own lives which  occurs once they see it so in an effort  to protect themselves survivors blind  themselves employing bandanas or  blindfolds to make sure they never  Glimpse the evil creatures it's a  harrowing film that promotes curiosity  over its biggest mysteries long after  the credits roll  [Music]

